= Wilhelm Pieck

A carpenter from Guben, a founder of the party, and a survivor: he was arrested with Luxemburg and Liebknecht on 15 January and walked out alive. He is no theorist. He keeps the offices open and the money counted.

- @finances
- @veterans
- @root: Return to main

@finances
title: Put the Finances in Order
subtitle: 2 funds.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 4; last_advisor_action = 1; resources += 2

Dues are collected, debts are chased and the accounts are balanced. Pieck signs every receipt himself.

@veterans
title: Bring Back the Old Spartacists
subtitle: Veterans who drifted away return to work. The districts steady.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 4;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] += 3;
}
Q.unity += 4;
!}

Pieck writes to every comrade from the wartime circles whose address he still has. Many of them answer.
